   "en": "⟦0⟧. The buildings file is used for determining into which sea province the naval bases and floating harbours will go out into, alongside positioning building models. This information is necessary when attempting to use any naval base or floating harbour, as the game would have no idea via which province the province connects to the sea otherwise. The game also checks this information when attempting to ⟦1⟧ a naval base, and if the game attempts to evaluate an invalid naval base definition, the game gets stuck in an infinite loop of attempting to obtain the naval base information, resulting in a CPU/GPU overload and a game crash.",
